// expect-error: extern function `rok_gc_register_type` is declared twice with different signatures: `fn(u32, usize) -> ()` here, `fn(u32, ConstPtr<u8>) -> ()` elsewhere; a `rok_*` symbol is the runtime's: declare it with the runtime's signature
// `rok::core::rt` declares the runtime symbols codegen calls on its own:
